# Feature architecture

Mirror **`src/features/users/`**. Route pages inject hook state into a **stateless** view. Do not put fetch/modal CRUD in `app/` pages or fat “page components” that mix both.

## Layers

| Layer | Path | Job |
|-------|------|-----|
| Route | `src/app/(app)/…/page.tsx` | Shell + `const page = useXListPage(); return <TablePageViewport><XListPage {...page} /></TablePageViewport>` |
| Hook | `features/<f>/hooks/use-*-list-page.ts(x)` | State, `run()`, modals, RBAC |
| View | `features/<f>/components/pages/*-list-page.tsx` | Props → UI only (`TableSkeleton` while `!loaded`) |
| Actions | `features/<f>/actions/` | Server `ActionResult` + `authorize` |
| Forms / tables | `components/forms`, `components/tables` | FieldDefs, `*Form`, columns, `toXTableRow` |
| Types | `features/<f>/types/` | Domain types (no React) |

```tsx
// ✅ route
"use client"
import { TablePageViewport } from "@/components/shared/table"

export default function Page() {
  const page = useUserListPage()
  return (
    <TablePageViewport>
      <UserListPage {...page} />
    </TablePageViewport>
  )
}
```

```tsx
// ❌ logic in the route or a stateful page component that also renders the table
```

## Folder checklist (new vertical)

1. `types/` → `actions/` → `hooks/` → `components/{forms,tables,pages}/`
2. Shared zod → `src/lib/schemas/`
3. RBAC → `permissions.ts` (org-role matrix)
4. Tenant scope → `session.activeOrganizationId` on all tenant-owned reads/writes; reject cross-org relation IDs
5. Route wires hook → view inside `TablePageViewport`; nav entry in `navigation.ts`
6. Removal: soft-delete (`deletedAt`) for org entities; membership status for members; workflow status when that is the domain model
7. Optional: `logActivity({ userId, organizationId, activity, … })` on privileged writes
8. Extend tenant-isolation matrix (`.docs/components/testing.md`) when the vertical is tenant-owned

## Import hygiene

- Views do not call server actions or `useError().run` for page load — hooks do.
- Client never imports `*/server` or `errors/server`.
- Feature `index.ts` stays client-safe (types / forms), not actions.

See `.docs/components/architecture.md` for the full guide.
